#: includes/class-settings-registry.php:1277
msgid "The number of sign-ins for the every-few-sign-ins trigger."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings-registry.php:1286
msgid "How many open sessions an account may have before the trigger applies."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings-registry.php:1292
msgid "Require 2FA on password reset"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-settings-registry.php:1293
msgid "Ask for the second factor during a password reset, so a hijacked mailbox is not enough on its own."
